":0.21947674404732742,"h":0.013176317020338391,"w":0.38444442749023439,"text":"Hearing about wars, economic crises, and natural"},{"w":0.17999999999999999,"text":"disasters made Wayne a.","x":0.060000001416666643,"h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.23387755102997043},{"text":"(feel) so","y":0.23240281552934816,"x":0.34215478872980121,"h":0.011938555191974287,"w":0.062357087135314959},{"text":"depressed that he stopped b_","y":0.24563953523893378,"h":0.01453488252600843,"x":0.060000003222222133,"w":0.22},{"w":0.059999999999999998,"text":"(watch)","x":0.37555555591666667,"y":0.24709302339115435,"h":0.010174418079609837},{"y":0.26162790726348972,"h":0.010208827427455436,"text":"the news last week.","x":0.057777783401136526,"w":0.1466666603088379},{"h":0.01309682028634207,"x":0.035555555777777775,"w":0.35999999999999999,"y":0.27469387776904364,"text":"3 A few months ago my grandparents decided"},{"w":0.25555555343627928,"y":0.28775510227541501,"text":"(go) on a trip around Europe. This","h":0.01311699069276151,"x":0.17111111331889733},{"y":0.29751843341944151,"w":0.16742988586425783,"text":"time next week theyb.","h":0.018336643296845145,"x":0.057430857403192377},{"x":0.32444444870465078,"y":0.30367346938743645,"h":0.010280018631292909,"w":0.12888888359069822,"text":"(stay) in a chalet"},{"text":"in the Swiss Alps.","x":0.057777782082239139,"y":0.31673469396488796,"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.13111110687255861},{"y":0.3297959179879093,"text":"4 Lily and Jack love a","h":0.013227338207011274,"w":0.16888887405395508,"x":0.035555561787837323},{"text":"attention. Theyb","y":0.34264634005044892,"x":0.059909420289382675,"w":0.12462560653686522,"h":0.013835226564991254},{"y":0.32979591851193102,"x":0.3066666690818603,"text":"(be) the centre of","w":0.13555555343627929,"h":0.010320360222641267},{"x":0.28666666845056832,"y":0.34285714251251287,"h":0.014700997021733553,"w":0.15333333015441891,"text":"(always \/ talk) about"},{"text":"their lives.","x":0.05996644251985167,"y":0.3574511029160794,"w":0.075622673034667964,"h":0.010388491883569939},{"x":0.035555555997803585,"y":0.37209302347829998,"text":"5","w":0.01111111044883728,"h":0.0087209296713069984},{"x":0.057777783119276123,"h":0.013108685551857513,"text":"In some countries, anyone a","y":0.37061224462562126,"w":0.21111110687255857},{"x":0.37329634468888501,"w":0.073407311439514178,"y":0.37197844107990818,"h":0.01040358329305846,"text":"(enter) an"},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"airport has to go through security control, not just","y":0.38517441893627624,"x":0.060000006840825792,"w":0.37555553436279299},{"x":0.058976133555501312,"y":0.39770006808741942,"h":0.016749315845723034,"w":0.10012616157531738,"text":"passengers b"},{"y":0.39825581357252116,"x":0.26222222293722647,"w":0.1177777767181396,"h":0.013172757674236757,"text":"(depart) from it."},{"text":"* * Complete the reviews with one word in each gap.","w":0.44,"x":0.024444437111111342,"y":0.41860465107252121,"h":0.013232084001813638},{"h":0.013169198328134901,"w":0.44444442749023438,"text":"7 * * Complete the text with the correct form of the","y":0.077034883503480533,"x":0.49111112514377153},{"w":0.36444442749023431,"x":0.51555556858821605,"y":0.093023256058305526,"h":0.010242049937345565,"text":"words in the box. There are two extra words."},{"text":"bitter equal health important","x":0.53777778855635561,"w":0.26888887405395512,"y":0.11918367339671332,"h":0.011630279774568542},{"x":0.53777778245450403,"y":0.13372093028763754,"w":0.2488888740539551,"h":0.013217845060387479,"text":"notify other permit require"},{"y":0.46366279088752071,"w":0.14888888359069824,"text":"YOUR COMMENTS","x":0.057777781915761967,"h":0.010214760060213046},{"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.29333332061767581,"y":0.48979591837907699,"text":"When we arrived at the B&B, the hosts","x":0.060000011246717513},{"text":"welcomed us and showed us around. They were","x":0.060000014551178892,"y":0.50285714298068951,"w":0.36444442749023442,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"x":0.060000016798990786,"y":0.51591836747335429,"h":0.013151400040606998,"text":"so friendly that they made everyone feel at","w":0.32666664123535155},{"w":0.33111110687255862,"h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.062222221030387423,"y":0.5305232561455786,"text":"ease. Thank you so much, Andy and Harriet!"},{"w":0.31555555343627928,"y":0.55795918366632935,"x":0.062222220126304857,"text":"The cottage is set in the picturesque English","h":0.011836734693877582},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.57102040813228305,"x":0.062222229682996899,"w":0.32222221374511717,"text":"countryside as advertised, but there was no"},{"h":0.013248695062131222,"x":0.17333333420151562,"w":0.2022222137451172,"text":"water for a day of our stay.","y":0.58430232549112593},{"w":0.33777778625488286,"h":0.013228524655711893,"text":"We had to use a hand pump to get water for","y":0.59738372060377121,"x":0.062222221594780754},{"y":0.61036179214430064,"text":"cooking or washing, b","w":0.16503751754760743,"x":0.061953314929255751,"h":0.015311900547572477},{"h":0.0072674420415138608,"text":"was","w":0.031111109256744374,"x":0.3311111116494056,"y":0.61482558135933019},{"x":0.062222222370749238,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"a major inconvenience!","y":0.62645348873278806,"w":0.17555555343627929},{"w":0.34222221374511719,"y":0.65261627938685773,"x":0.037777779164478532,"text":"2 The flat we stayed in had every household","h":0.011627906487912565},{"x":0.17111110664406567,"y":0.66715116313201273,"w":0.20444444656372071,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"you can think of, including"},{"w":0.35555553436279297,"x":0.062222237263047833,"text":"a dishwasher and a tumble dryer. It would have","y":0.68023255831127627,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"h":0.010359515754543969,"w":0.15999999999999998,"text":"been useful to have b","y":0.69331395364914861,"x":0.064444446044444423},{"y":0.69315031450782039,"x":0.32884440937394877,"h":0.01050169652822075,"w":0.086755628585815425,"text":"chair in the"},{"h":0.013175130571637883,"y":0.70775510236746886,"text":"living room, though. One wasn't enough for the","w":0.33777774810791017,"x":0.062222234390489461},{"y":0.72033586782462156,"w":0.067069783210754394,"h":0.011363147813446717,"text":"two of us.","x":0.06424288627815232},{"y":0.74408163241693304,"h":0.013185809388452596,"text":"I fell in love with the town at first sight. I grew","x":0.060000014271213049,"w":0.34666664123535157},{"text":"up in a similar place, where everything was","h":0.011627906487912454,"w":0.32222221374511717,"y":0.75872093041883448,"x":0.064444451905219108},{"y":0.77306122453187076,"w":0.062222218513488775,"h":0.0089795918367346905,"text":"within a","x":0.064444447335848171},{"x":0.22666667171224775,"h":0.010238490591243821,"w":0.18666666030883788,"y":0.77180232580031138,"text":"distance. We didn't even"},{"text":"to have a car in those days.","y":0.7863372096920902,"w":0.2111111068725586,"h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.17111111559149847},{"h":0.0087209296713069984,"text":"4","x":0.040000000929379775,"w":0.0199999988079071,"y":0.81395348855581939},{"x":0.060000004758165096,"w":0.21111110687255863,"text":"I highly recommend Josh, a","y":0.81249999970987585,"h":0.013214285714285734},{"x":0.37555555609384994,"h":0.0072674420415138608,"y":0.81540697670816742,"w":0.031111109256744429,"text":"was"},{"w":0.23821296691894533,"y":0.82544392941376288,"x":0.064244098141275852,"text":"our guide last weekend. You'll b","h":0.013572082519531237},{"w":0.33333332061767579,"x":0.06444445496893976,"h":0.013197674653968039,"text":"with laughter when you hear his jokes about","y":0.83999999983673757},{"h":0.013217845060387368,"text":"famous historical figures.","x":0.064444444686279245,"y":0.85306122485182978,"w":0.18888889312744139},{"x":0.040000000220025811,"text":"5","y":0.88226744205388152,"w":0.01111111044883728,"h":0.0087209296713069984},{"text":"The restaurant had a fantastic waterfront","h":0.010206454530054199,"y":0.8808139538235672,"x":0.064444442512247943,"w":0.30666666030883788},{"x":0.064444446913384468,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"location, but we were bitterly a","y":0.89534883745371818,"w":0.23333332061767575},{"text":"when the food arrived. We ordered two main","x":0.06444444784444435,"y":0.90843023277705559,"w":0.33999999999999997,"h":0.010345277591627511},{"h":0.010325106795953221,"text":"dishes and b","x":0.066666668967234971,"y":0.92151162806775333,"w":0.093333330154418942},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.13555555343627929,"x":0.26222222102260118,"text":"was tasty! We left","y":0.92151162824829169},{"text":"hungry and angry!","x":0.064444445916666634,"y":0.93591836738372203,"h":0.013209539919483482,"w":0.14000000000000001},{"text":"The first months are difficult","w":0.27333332061767579,"h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.17714285717881195,"x":0.51333334196893987},{"x":0.51333334234966344,"text":"Going to university is one of the most important events in","h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.38222221374511722,"y":0.19469387754171308},{"text":"any young person's life. You rent a room in a different city","w":0.38,"x":0.51111110477777799,"h":0.010268153755032317,"y":0.20775510186907487},{"w":0.35111110687255864,"x":0.5111111073785356,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"and, suddenly, you don't have to ask your parents for","y":0.21947674452736154},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"to do anything anymore. You can go out every","w":0.30222221374511715,"x":0.60222222673855241,"y":0.23102040834380422},{"text":"night if you want. With dozens of welcome parties for new","x":0.51333334661599384,"w":0.38444442749023433,"h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.24408163258038684},{"text":"and exchange students, the first months on campus are","x":0.51333334146565757,"h":0.010299002978266469,"w":0.36666664123535164,"y":0.25714285731517217},{"h":0.010319173773940649,"text":"particularly busy.","x":0.51333333586723495,"y":0.27020408171693011,"w":0.11333333015441893},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.51333334034149825,"w":0.39111110687255868,"y":0.28488372110197391,"text":"During this time many young people realise that it's difficult"},{"y":0.29795918381798969,"text":"lifestyle. Some can't believe that their","w":0.25111110687255855,"x":0.66222222748038717,"h":0.010204081632653073},{"x":0.51333334909343531,"y":0.30959302341659045,"text":"favourite dish takes more than an hour to make. 3","w":0.32666664123535161,"h":0.010174418079609726},{"h":0.010174418079609726,"x":0.51333333267255854,"text":"don't want to waste their time in the kitchen. Fast food","w":0.35777778625488277,"y":0.32267441879449743},{"x":0.51333333769553835,"y":0.33428571437623866,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"becomes an attractive alternative and you end up eating it,","w":0.38888889312744135},{"x":0.51333334129002539,"text":"even though you know it's not good for you.","w":0.28666666030883792,"h":0.011836734693877471,"y":0.34734693888095203},{"h":0.011836734693877471,"text":"Luckily, after a few months, things slow down and most","x":0.51333334164158362,"y":0.36326530607183161,"w":0.36666664123535153},{"text":"students begin to focus on their coursework. If you don't","y":0.37500000009906698,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.37333332061767577,"x":0.51333334252449536},{"y":0.38808139569015232,"w":0.37555553436279288,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"start thinking about your exams in advance and do really","x":0.51333333767045564},{"x":0.5133333294681397,"w":0.22444444656372065,"text":"badly, you might receive a letter 4","y":0.39959183682547317,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"h":0.010524906236298204,"y":0.40098754696830841,"x":0.81550671577775813,"w":0.084542121887207111,"text":"you that you"},{"text":"won't be able to return to the university next year.","y":0.41424418647860595,"h":0.01024560928344731,"x":0.51333333580664942,"w":0.32888889312744141},{"text":"Having fun and passing exams are 5","w":0.23777776718139643,"x":0.51555556452041273,"h":0.013082582123425501,"y":0.42732558101438167},{"y":0.42997981999150992,"x":0.83103794910359374,"w":0.06903521060943596,"text":"important","h":0.0092264066423688451},{"h":0.010174418079609726,"text":"in the first year of university. Still, it's useful to remember that","y":0.44186046543330559,"w":0.38888889312744146,"x":0.51333332635294593},{"h":0.011836734693877693,"text":"you're less likely to be kicked out if you spend some time","y":0.4534693879177909,"x":0.51333333582516816,"w":0.36888889312744144},{"h":0.011764682069116739,"text":"in the library.","x":0.5153472347242587,"y":0.46722812405407921,"w":0.084861087799072199},{"text":"8 * * * Complete the second sentence so that it has","x":0.49555557385454635,"y":0.50436046489882946,"w":0.44666664123535155,"h":0.013190555183254848},{"x":0.52000000299183469,"text":"a similar meaning to the first. Use no more than six","w":0.40888889312744137,"h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.51877551029435098},{"y":0.5318367348838513,"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.30222221374511715,"x":0.52000000801633006,"text":"words, including the word in capitals."},{"y":0.54796511609795728,"h":0.013259373878946046,"w":0.37777778625488279,"x":0.54666666715033629,"text":"I haven't got enough money to go to the concert."},{"x":0.54874813358656016,"text":"CAN'T","y":0.56211836077587063,"w":0.053614845275878897,"h":0.0094842085546376076},{"text":"I can't afford to go to the concert.","x":0.54640337136886574,"y":0.57317014999283911,"h":0.015811118301080174,"w":0.25832391738891602},{"x":0.52222222269366059,"y":0.58866279112976871,"h":0.010174418079609837,"w":0.013333332538604692,"text":"1"},{"text":"I tested Anna and she tested me on the new vocabulary.","h":0.01026578046837634,"x":0.54222221920260982,"y":0.58857142862593437,"w":0.41111110687255858},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.60174418643627625,"w":0.060000000000000053,"text":"OTHER","x":0.54666666625000004},{"text":"Anna and I","w":0.084557914733886741,"x":0.54883215479866709,"y":0.61462144037328104,"h":0.010582700456891692},{"y":0.61464539844608901,"text":"on the","x":0.8132624146118671,"h":0.0090812963368941402,"w":0